              <td height="2">
                <div align="center"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="5" align="center"><b> 
                  Flagrant anti-Palestinian editorial line at the Washington Post 
                  gives the lie to ombudsman's protestations</b></font></div>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr align="left" valign="top"> 
              <td height="2">
